# ASCII hyphens only

Never insert Unicode dash characters in this repo:

- En dash `–` (U+2013)
- Em dash `—` (U+2014)
- Minus sign `−`, non-breaking hyphen, figure dash, horizontal bar, fullwidth hyphen

Always use the ASCII hyphen-minus `-` (U+002D) instead.

- Comments, docs, UI strings, prompts, seeds: `-`
- Numeric ranges: `200-299`, `5-10` (not en dash)
- Empty / missing table cells: `-` (not em dash)

Exception: only use a Unicode dash when a spec or external API literally requires that exact character (rare). Prefer ASCII everywhere else.

When editing existing text, replace any `–` or `—` you touch with `-`.
